---
InheritParentConfig: true

# GoogleTest's TEST() registers each test through a static object, ASSERT_TRUE(value)
# guards optional access in a way the dataflow check cannot follow, and tests seed
# generators with constants to stay reproducible.
Checks: >
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -bugprone-random-generator-seed
